<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">version with modernised words (Tamao Fujita)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">after the Second World War</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new words to the song</span></li></ul></section>
